# Database providers

- Read `docs/databases/00-data-contract.md` before schema or connection changes.
- Set `DATABASE_PROVIDER` and `DATABASE_URL` in `.env.local` only — never commit.
- Apps import `@superapp/data`; adapters live in `packages/data/src/adapters/`.
- Run `pnpm run db:validate` before feature implementation.
- Do not add a second ORM or `mongoose.connect` in route handlers.
- Health: `GET /api/health/db` must not return secrets.
